    fix(cheeseburger): drop the duplicate serial terminal console
    
    TerminalDxe binds SerialIo, and on this board SerialIo is the frame buffer
    console that FrameBufferSerialPortLib draws.  Every ConOut line was therefore
    rendered a second time on top of the GraphicsConsole copy, at a different
    size and position.  There is no UART, so remove TerminalDxe; UniXNU keeps
    using SerialIo directly for its log.

diff --git a/Platforms/Msm8998Pkg/Device/oneplus/cheeseburger/cheeseburger.fdf b/Platforms/Msm8998Pkg/Device/oneplus/cheeseburger/cheeseburger.fdf
index 7f6724f..5941886 100644
